></name><name><surname>Bouchard</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><volume>273</volume><issue>5</issue><year>1995</year><fpage>402</fpage><lpage>407</lpage><article-title>Physical activity and public health. A recommendation from the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention and the American College of Sports Medicine</article-title><source>JAMA</source><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7823386</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><volume>53</volume><issue>RR-11</issue><year>2004</year><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>18</lpage><article-title>Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Indicators for chronic disease surveillance</article-title><source>MMWR Recomm Rep</source></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jiles</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Flowers</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>McCracken</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><volume>54</volume><issue>8</issue><year>2005</year><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>116</lpage><article-title>Surveillance for certain health behaviors among states and selected local areas--Behavioral Risk Factor Surveillance System, United States, 2003</article-title><source>MMWR Surveill Summ</source><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16319816</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal"><volume>54</volume><issue>20</issue><year>2005</year><fpage>509</fpage><lpage>513</lpage><article-title>Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Cigarette smoking among adults--United States, 2003</article-title><source>MMWR Morb Mortal Wkly Rep</source><pub-id pub-id-type="pmi